

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:38
translate zh ves_isOutHunting_ff8744ec:

    # MC "(维斯 must be out hunting.)"
    MC "(维斯一定是出去打猎了。)"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:39
translate zh ves_isOutHunting_e465bbc4:

    # MC "(I might be able to catch her tomorrow.)"
    MC "(也许明天我能碰到她。)"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:49
translate zh ves_firstmeet_61479d0c:

    # "Opening the flap of her tent, I stepped inside to find 维斯 sitting cross legged on the floor, inspecting her axes before sharpening them with a vicious-looking rock."
    "我掀开帐篷的门帘走进去，发现维斯盘腿坐在地上，正检查她的斧头，随后用一块看起来很凶险的石头打磨它们。"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:50
translate zh ves_firstmeet_80992f0b:

    # "Looking around the tent which flapped with each gust of wind, I observed that she had done a remarkable job to have survived as long as she had out here in these harsh lands."
    "环顾着随风拍打的帐篷，我注意到她在这片严酷的土地上生存至今，可见她在这一方面很出色。"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:51
translate zh ves_firstmeet_2c9aacee:

    # "Sprawled across the floor were a mixture of fur rugs made from the hides of animals from her many hunts and cloth she had found and hung decoratively."
    "地板上散落着混合的毛皮地毯，由她多次狩猎获得的兽皮制成，还有她找到并装饰性悬挂的布料。"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:52
translate zh ves_firstmeet_80cc8164:

    # "Here and there were various pieces of equipment and intricate looking items she had fashioned out here in this small corner of the desert."
    "四处散落着各种装备和看起来精巧的物品，都是她在这片沙漠小角落亲手制作的。"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:53
translate zh ves_firstmeet_63e642cd:

    # "There was a small wooden tub, presumably for washing in but I couldn’t even begin to guess where she managed to find enough water to get close to filling it in these barren lands."
    "有一个小木桶，大概是用来洗漱的，但我完全无法想象她在这片贫瘠之地如何找到足够的水来装满它。"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:54
translate zh ves_firstmeet_03f711ff:

    # "Her bed was comprised of a cluster of blue quilts and pillows that seemed almost out of place in the desert, had she stolen them?"
    "她的床由一堆蓝色被褥和枕头组成，在沙漠中显得格格不入——这些是偷来的吗？"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:55
translate zh ves_firstmeet_f29e70bc:

    # "The bedframe itself was notably made with some craftsmanship, further raising my suspicions on the matter, but I decided not to pry too much into her affairs."
    "床架本身明显带有工艺痕迹，更增添了我的怀疑，但我决定不过多打探她的事。"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:56
translate zh ves_firstmeet_6e5075fc:

    # "Here and there were jars filled with either water or small dead animals in some preservative substance, scorpions, beetles and such..."
    "四处摆放着罐子，有的装着水，有的装着浸泡在防腐剂中的小动物尸体，比如蝎子、甲虫之类..."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:57
translate zh ves_firstmeet_df6a8060:

    # "Presumably kept as small rations of food for when the dried-out meat on the lines outside was running low."
    "大概是作为小份口粮储备，以备外面晾晒的肉干短缺时使用。"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:58
translate zh ves_firstmeet_f16dfa89:

    # "As she tested the sharpness of her axe with her thumb, she looked up coolly at me."
    "她用拇指测试斧刃锋利度时，冷冷地抬头看向我。"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:59
translate zh ves_firstmeet_2252db6b:

    # VES @ talk "What do you want, human?"
    VES @ talk "人类，你想要什么？"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:69
translate zh ves_dial_talk_5d6f3c6e:

    # VES @ talk "What is it, human?"
    VES @ talk "什么事，人类？"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:75
translate zh ves_dial_beenout_c1cc84bf:

    # VES @ talk "Not yet, but I will be soon."
    VES @ talk "还没，但很快会去。"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:76
translate zh ves_dial_beenout_f48a09c0:

    # VES @ talk "Can’t risk supplies getting too low."
    VES @ talk "不能让补给消耗太多。"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:80
translate zh ves_dial_seenanything_b917f69f:

    # VES @ talk "Just your usual small parties of Demorai moving through the sands."
    VES @ talk "只有德莫莱的小队像往常一样在沙地中行进。"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:81
translate zh ves_dial_seenanything_565c2af8:

    # VES @ talk "Oh, and some Skorn... Not much else."
    VES @ talk "哦，还有些斯考恩...没什么特别的。"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:82
translate zh ves_dial_seenanything_396272dc:

    # VES @ talk "Though I did find a strange temple out here once..."
    VES @ talk "不过我在这发现过一座奇怪的寺庙..."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:83
translate zh ves_dial_seenanything_1bd97503:

    # "I raised an eyebrow"
    "我挑起眉毛"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:84
translate zh ves_dial_seenanything_84664fbb:

    # MC @ talk "A temple?"
    MC @ talk "寺庙？"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:85
translate zh ves_dial_seenanything_bf3b9ac7:

    # VES @ talk "Just some ruinous thing... Southeast of here."
    VES @ talk "只是个废墟...在东南方向。"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:86
translate zh ves_dial_seenanything_43697f58:

    # MC @ talk "Hm, I see..."
    MC @ talk "嗯，明白了..."

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:90
translate zh ves_dial_bye_be8114ea:

    # VES @ talk "Very well."
    VES @ talk "很好。"

# game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:91
translate zh ves_dial_bye_f300e1c6:

    # VES @ talk "As you are, human."
    VES @ talk "随你便，人类。"

translate zh strings:

    # game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:15
    old "Talk to Ves"
    new "和维斯说话"

    # game/data/characters/ves/dialogue.rpy:26
